{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/bundle"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Bundle"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a bundle to name a set of components that often go together, such as everything a ship","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs, so you can spawn them in one step and keep that set in one place. Declare the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bundle’s contents in its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle\/body-9bv1p"},{"text":" property. The body is built by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/BundleBuilder"},{"text":", so you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can list components and other bundles, and use ","type":"text"},{"code":"if","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"switch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and optional values:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Armor: Component { var rating: Int }","","struct Ship: Bundle {","    var position: Position","    var armored: Bool","","    var body: some Bundle {","        position","        Velocity(dx: 0, dy: 0)","        if armored { Armor(rating: 10) }","    }","}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spa